== Effects ==
* Grants one {{E|Black Heart}}.
* Activates {{i|The Necronomicon}} effect upon taking damage if Isaac's total [[health]] ({{E|Red Heart}}s, {{E|Soul Heart}}s, and Black Hearts) is at one heart or less afterwards.
* {{dlc|r}} Adds +40 damage to {{i|The Necronomicon}} and similar effects, such as {{E|Black Heart}}s.
* {{transformation contribution|Necromancer}}

== Synergies ==
* {{t|Black Feather}}: Counts as an 'evil' item, granting a damage up.
* {{dlc+|r}} {{I|Blood Rights}} / {{I|Dry Baby}} / {{i|The Negative}} / {{i|Heartbreak}} / {{p|XIII - Death}} / {{p|Black Rune}}: The damage boost is applied to these items.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc+|r}} {{t|A Missing Page}}/{{i|Missing Page 2}}: The damage increase from the trinket/copies of Missing Page 2 stacks, adding +40 damage per stack to The Necronomicon and similar effects.{{dlc-}}

