== Trivia ==
* {{i|The Necronomicon}}, {{t|A Missing Page}}, and Missing Page 2 are all references to the Necronomicon and its missing pages appearing in [[wikipedia: The Evil Dead (franchise)|Evil Dead]].
** Which, in turn, is a reference to ''[[wikipedia:The Necronomicon|The Necronomicon]]'', a fictional grimoire appearing in the works of horror writer [[wikipedia: H.P.Lovecraft|H.P. Lovecraft]].

